### List Patient Files & Clinical Attachments
# @prompt tenantId The UUID of the tenant
# @prompt patientId The UUID of the patient
GET http://localhost:8000/api/tenant/patients/{{patientId}}/files
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

### Attach Document / Exam Result to Patient
# @prompt tenantId The UUID of the tenant
# @prompt patientId The UUID of the patient
POST http://localhost:8000/api/tenant/patients/{{patientId}}/files
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

